id: url
path: url.html
title: Url
icon: ↗
source: runtime/stdlib_url.cpp
description.ru: URL parse/build, percent coding и вложенные query maps.
description.en: URL parsing/building, percent coding and nested query maps.
note.ru: Pure: модуль не выполняет сетевые запросы.
note.en: Pure: this module performs no network requests.
drift_ignore:

method: Url.parse(text)
ru: Разбирает URL в Map частей.
en: Parses a URL into a parts Map.
example:
url = Url.parse("https://example.com:8443/api?q=amber")
url[:host]
# => "example.com"
.end

method: Url.build(parts)
ru: Собирает URL из Map частей.
en: Builds a URL from a parts Map.
example:
text = Url.build({
  scheme: "https", host: "example.com", path: "/api"
})
.end

method: Url.percent_encode(text)
ru: Кодирует bytes вне unreserved set.
en: Encodes bytes outside the unreserved set.
example:
text = Url.percent_encode("a b/!")
# => "a%20b%2F%21"
.end

method: Url.percent_decode(text)
ru: Декодирует percent escapes.
en: Decodes percent escapes.
example:
text = Url.percent_decode("a%20b%2F%21")
# => "a b/!"
.end

method: Url.parse_query(text)
ru: Разбирает repeated/bracket query keys.
en: Parses repeated and bracketed query keys.
example:
query = Url.parse_query("tag[]=vm&tag[]=lang")
query["tag"]
# ["vm", "lang"]
.end

method: Url.build_query(map)
ru: Строит query string из nested Map/List.
en: Builds a query string from nested Map/List values.
example:
query = Url.build_query({q: "amber", tag: ["vm", "lang"]})
.end
